unity-gtk4-menu (0.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Exports a GTK4 header bar menu to the Unity global menu
    and the HUD by setting it as the application menu bar before realize.
  * show-application-name setting controls whether the exported entry is named
    after the application or given a neutral label.

